  "daily_overview": "今日科技界聚焦 AI Agent 的快速演进，从 GPT-6 Astra 的落地应用到具身智能上下文学习的新赛道，人工智能正从概念走向深度生产力集成，个人开发者与小型团队成为创新核心力量。财经层面，全球宏观经济呈现复杂信号：中国通过注资银行与保险业以维稳增长，而美伊地缘摩擦引发了能源市场波动，全球通胀压力重现导致货币政策再次陷入紧缩预期，航空业则因安全与气候风险面临新的经营压力。时政领域，德国极右翼势力在地方选举中取得显著进展引发关注，俄乌冲突下的地缘外交博弈虽有接触但和平预期依然渺茫，全球政治版图的极化趋势对资本市场情绪构成了持续扰动。\n\nToday's tech focus is on the rapid evolution of AI Agents—ranging from the deployment of GPT-6 Astra to emerging niches in Embodied ICL—demonstrating AI's shift toward deep productivity integration where individual developers play a central role. In finance, global macroeconomic signals are mixed: China is injecting capital into banks to sustain growth, while US-Iran tensions have stoked energy market volatility. Persistent inflation fears are triggering a return to monetary tightening, while the aviation sector faces fresh operational pressures from safety and climate risks. Politically, the significant gains of far-right parties in German regional elections have drawn global attention, while peace negotiations in the Russia-Ukraine conflict remain stalled, keeping geopolitical risk high for global markets.",
